<p><span id="u-credit-00413" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00413" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00413-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6273721&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607416673" alt="EdwardNewtChen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6273721)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;">EdwardNewtChen</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1601132849 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">26 Sep 2020 15:07</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00321/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个空的便携式小型工具包，当持有者正在修理其它物品时，可以从该项目内取出<em>任何</em>需要的东西。若没有进行修理活动，该项目内部不会出现任何物品。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-15后勤部员工A██<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>仍被A██所有并允许仍被使用。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>你不会想象到一个员工先从一个小包里面拽出一把铁锹时的样子&#8230;卧槽那是什么？！挖掘机铲斗？！！以后可别他妈让这个人去施工区帮忙了——Dr.Fishbone</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00321" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00321" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00321-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6127045); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6127045&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607416673" alt="Dr Fishbone" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6127045)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6127045); return false;">Dr Fishbone</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1594947600 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">17 Jul 2020 01:00</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00014/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个马克杯，当其内部装有任何液体时，将无法采用除饮用外的其他任何手段使其内部的液体与该项目分离。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██省██市<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>于Site-CN-03无价值物品收容区<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>不要往这里面装一些奇奇怪怪的东西，否则谁装的就由谁来负责喝掉。</em>——站点主管██</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00014" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00014" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00014-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4546338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607416673" alt="miku1314" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4546338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;">miku1314</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1585806218 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">02 Apr 2020 05:43</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00471/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把普通的乌木椅子，但除了方琪博士外的如何基金会员工都会认为项目具有重大研究价值，并尝试将其归为SCP项目。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>方琪博士的个人实验室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被方琪博士牢牢地嵌在了其实验室的水泥地上<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>方琪博士：那只是我姐留下的一把普通的乌木椅子啊，我只是喜欢ta才带到基金会的呀！<br />
Dr.Give Up:我知道了！你才是SCP-2066██本体吧！而那椅子就是SCP-2066██-1！<br />
方琪博士：啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00471" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00471" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00471-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/i-give-up" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6937520); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6937520&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607416673" alt="I give up" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6937520)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/i-give-up" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6937520); return false;">I give up</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1606644660 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">29 Nov 2020 10:11</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
